silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_05_probe_ungated_render_concrete_anchor_6#ungatedrendershortcutsource silm:hasLongDescription "The UngatedRenderShortcutSource is The second SourcePhrase cell in the lower row of the R5 diagram is the source of the dashed-red \"ungated\" shortcut to RenderedDiagram. For the Mittens fixture this is the same string \"Mittens measured at 4.1kg on 2024-11-01\" — but here the agent attempts to render the string directly into a figure box without ingest, type, or validate. The duplicated cell exists to make this shortcut visually nameable; the dashed-red rendering signals refusal status." .
